      "description": "Hybrid quantum-classical GAN (HQGAN) for synthetic financial data generation using a quantum circuit generator and classical neural-network discriminator on proprietary Banco BV FGTS approval data.",
      "algorithm": {
        "family": "hybrid",
        "variant": "Hybrid quantum-classical generative adversarial network with quantum generator and classical discriminator; resource-efficient Quantum Patch GAN-inspired design with a single sub-generator",
