      "problem_formulation": {
        "encoding_method": "angle_encoding",
        "encoding_details": "Classical features are normalized to [0, 1] and encoded via Ry rotations on data qubits; one categorical feature is ordinal-encoded first. The generator uses 4 data qubits and 1 ancilla qubit. Because the generator output capacity is constrained by 2^NG, two zero-valued padding features were added to reach 16 features.",
        "objective_function": "Adversarial GAN objective with BCE loss; generator aims to minimize log(1 - D(G(z))) while discriminator maximizes log(D(x)) + log(1 - D(G(z)))",
        "constraints_handling": "Partial measurement and tracing out ancilla qubits to induce nonlinearity; no explicit penalty formulation reported",
